Biometric Electronic Voting System with Real-Time Authentication

Overview
This project is a secure electronic voting system using biometric fingerprint authentication and keypad verification to prevent unauthorized voting.

Features
- Fingerprint-based voter authentication
- Keypad input system
- Real-time vote verification
- Secure voting mechanism
- LCD display integration

Components Used
- Arduino UNO
- Fingerprint Sensor
- 4x4 Keypad
- LCD Display
- Buzzer
- Push Buttons

Technologies Used
- Embedded C
- Arduino IDE
- Embedded Systems

Applications
- College Elections
- Secure Digital Voting
- Smart Authentication Systems
